---
// Two ways to start: the BASELINE monitoring pilot (coming soon) and direct
// consulting (available now). This is the page's single loud conversion point —
// it absorbs the old ConsultBanner CTA and the old engagement Process.
---
<section id="start" class="bg-card py-24 border-t border-white/7">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">

    <div class="mb-16 max-w-2xl">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <div class="w-6 h-px bg-accent"></div>
        <span class="font-display text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.22em] uppercase text-accent">Two Ways To Start</span>
      </div>
      <h2
        class="font-display font-extrabold uppercase text-primary mb-4"
        style="font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px);"
      >Start Small. Start Sure.</h2>
      <p class="text-muted text-[15px] leading-relaxed">
        Prove the value on your own floor with a low-commitment monitoring pilot — or just
        book a call and talk through the problem. No sales pitch either way.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-white/7">

      <!-- BASELINE pilot -->
      <div class="relative bg-card p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-accent"></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
          <span class="font-display font-extrabold text-[22px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-primary">BASELINE</span>
          <span class="font-display text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-accent border border-accent/40 px-2 py-1">Coming Soon</span>
        </div>
        <p class="font-display text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-accent mb-5">The Monitoring Pilot</p>
        <p class="text-muted text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-6">
          BASELINE is a manufacturing IoT platform — a small kit on one machine, streaming
          live OEE, downtime, and MTBF to a dashboard in days. See what you've been missing
          before you commit to anything bigger.
        </p>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 mb-8">
          {[
            "Live OEE, downtime & MTBF in days",
            "No PLC changes, no line stoppage",
            "Your data stays on your network",
          ].map((f) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-muted text-[14px] leading-relaxed">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">→</span>{f}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-auto flex items-center gap-5">
          <a
            href="#contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center bg-accent hover:bg-accent-dark text-dark font-display font-bold text-[13px] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase px-6 py-3.5 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-0.5"
          >
            Join the Pilot List
          </a>
          <span class="font-display text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.15em] uppercase text-dim">Pricing coming soon</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Consulting now -->
      <div class="relative bg-card p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col">
        <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-white/15"></div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
          <span class="font-display font-extrabold text-[22px] uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-primary">Talk To Us</span>
          <span class="font-display text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-muted border border-white/15 px-2 py-1">Available Now</span>
        </div>
        <p class="font-display text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.12em] uppercase text-muted mb-5">Consulting & Automation</p>
        <p class="text-muted text-[15px] leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Already know the problem? We do the full spectrum — automation, PLC/SCADA, controls,
          process improvement. A free 30-minute call to scope it, no commitment.
        </p>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 mb-8">
          {[
            "Free 30-minute discovery call",
            "Written proposal, fixed or hourly",
            "Two people who build what they spec",
          ].map((f) => (
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-muted text-[14px] leading-relaxed">
              <span class="text-accent mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0">→</span>{f}
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-auto">
          <a
            href="#contact"
            class="inline-flex items-center border-2 border-accent text-accent hover:bg-accent hover:text-dark font-display font-bold text-[13px] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase px-6 py-3.5 transition-all duration-200"
          >
            Book a Free Consultation →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
